I've published draft-04 with the changes I mentioned, and a small tweak in
response to a follow-up comment Martin left on GitHub.
https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-tls-tls13-pkcs1-04.html
https://author-tools.ietf.org/iddiff?url1=3Ddraft-ietf-tls-tls13-pkcs1-03&u=
rl2=3Ddraft-ietf-tls-tls13-pkcs1-04&difftype=3D--html

On Mon, Sep 15, 2025 at 9:40=E2=80=AFAM Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com> wrote:

> Hi! We=E2=80=99re closing out the WGLC on this I-D. Once we come to closu=
re on
> Martin=E2=80=99s comments we will progress this.
>
> spt
>
